  "id": "sensory-interaction",
  "term": "sensory interaction",
  "definition": "Sensory interaction is the process by which physical information is conveyed through the senses and linked with action and thinking to support learning. In this packet, it refers especially to tactile and haptic experiences that help people engage actively, build multisensory understanding, and grasp abstract ideas through embodied experience.",
